OL,3,GNEWSAI regret surviving the e-bike fire
OL,4,Athat killed my family                  
OL,6,FWhen Scott Peden thinks of the night   
OL,7,Fhis family died in a fire caused by an 
OL,8,Fe-bike battery, he has one overriding  
OL,9,Fregret: "That I lived, and they        
OL,10,Fdidn't."                               
OL,12,FHis girlfriend Gemma Germeney, 31, and 
OL,13,Ftheir children Lilly, eight, and       
OL,14,FOliver, four, died after the battery   
OL,15,Fexploded in their Cambridge home on 30 
OL,16,FJune 2023.                             
OL,18,FAn inquest recorded conclusions of     
OL,19,Fdeath by misadventure.                 
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
